WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:52.480
[swords clanging]

3
00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:56.300
<b>The Leaders</b>

4
00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:54.880
[CLAW SOLDIER A]
Move it!
Get out of our way! Step aside!

5
00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.850
[ROYAL SOLDIER A]
Hey! Isn't that...?

6
00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:01.810
[CLAW SOLDIER A yells]

7
00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:06.380
[CLAW SOLDIER A]
No, Chaka! Please wait!

8
00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:04.790
Chaka!

9
00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:05.740
Please wait!

10
00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.120
[CROCODILE]
Hm?

11
00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:10.450
So who are they?

12
00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:12.120
The Guardians!

13
00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.360
The Kicking Claw Force!

14
00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:20.120
<b>Kicking Claw Force
Alabasta's Elite Guard Unit</b>

15
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.300
Don't attack, men.

16
00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:28.400
You'll only be throwing your lives away!

17
00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.480
[ROYAL SOLDIER A]
They broke the door down!

18
00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:34.740
[ROYAL SOLDIER B]
A daring move!

19
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:38.380
[ROYAL SOLDIER C]
Please! Save
His Majesty and Princess Vivi!

20
00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.380
[CLAW SOLDIER B]
Your Majesty!

21
00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.210
Defending you to the death
is not only our mission,

22
00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.320
it is the highest
honor and privilege!

23
00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.950
Therefore, we can't simply avoid him.

24
00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.750
He is one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea.

25
00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.960
The only way to beat him is to fight dirty.

26
00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:55.100
[ALL]
– We four are as one!
– We four are as one!

27
00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.060
We fight for your honor!

28
00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:59.430
To set things right!

29
00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:02.840
It seems that you have quite the reputation.

30
00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.340
Therefore, I will spare your lives.

31
00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.090
Leave now and go home.

32
00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:09.820
[CLAW SOLDIER A]
We can't do that.

33
00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:12.990
There is another reason
we will not withdraw.

34
00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.820
Reason?

35
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.240
If the rumors are true and you really are the ringleader,

36
00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:23.140
the architect of this whole rebellion...

37
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.230
[grunts]

38
00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:28.040
[gasps]
Those bruises!

39
00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.850
What have you men done?

40
00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:36.180
Shall I?

41
00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:39.480
You needn't waste your time on these cretins.

42
00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.910
[gasps]
They didn't!

43
00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:49.160
Chaka, what's happening to their bodies?

44
00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:53.080
I fear... to temporarily
increase their power,

45
00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.280
they drank the fatal elixir.

46
00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:01.090
It grants incredible strength,
but then kills the host.

47
00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.430
They're dead men!

48
00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.090
Oh, no!

49
00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.160
[chuckles]

50
00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.560
You bulked up to challenge
me. I'm flattered.

51
00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.800
But what good is victory if
you're not around to enjoy it?

52
00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:14.910
[CLAW SOLDIER B]
Chaka, please!

53
00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.410
Forgive us for doing this
without consulting you,

54
00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.550
but we had to take
drastic measures

55
00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:23.320
to end this country's suffering!

56
00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:45.340
Those idiots! How could they?

57
00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.120
[CLAW SOLDIER B]
We have to make him realize...

58
00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.580
...the fury of...

59
00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.510
[CLAW SOLDIERS yelling]

60
00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.040
[CROCODILE]
Huh.

61
00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.110
...this country!

62
00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.360
[CLAW SOLDIER A]
Huh?

63
00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:14.390
[CROCODILE]
That wasn't
the smartest decision.

64
00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.030
A person should value his life above all else.

65
00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.400
But it's too late for regrets, yes?

66
00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:25.900
[CROCODILE laughing]

67
00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.710
And if you're all going to die anyway,

68
00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:30.900
I don't have to bother killing you myself, right?

69
00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:34.170
You don't even have
the decency to fight?

70
00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.980
[gasps]

71
00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:52.920
Chaka, I'm sorry.

72
00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:58.160
[CROCODILE laughing]

73
00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:01.530
Behold, the very
definition of stupidity!

74
00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.100
[growls]

75
00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.120
You bastard!

76
00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.040
[growling]

77
00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.370
[VIVI]
Chaka!

78
00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.480
Chaka! This is senseless!

79
00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:19.140
You'll just be following them to their deaths!

80
00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.920
Ah. You're a Zoan type.

81
00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:26.560
[CHAKA]
Dog Dog Fruit. Model: Jackal!

82
00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:29.090
Howling Fangs!

83
00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:36.590
[CROCODILE]
I see you share
the same flaw as these fools.

84
00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.220
You'll die for others.

85
00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:51.100
<b>Medi Assembly Hall's Front
Alubarna North Block</b>

86
00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.360
[ZORO grunts]

87
00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:56.670
Dammit! Lost too much blood.

88
00:06:56.790 --> 00:07:00.240
Guess I should be thankful the cuts aren't that deep.

89
00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:03.140
But it does hurt like hell.

90
00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.480
[ZORO]
Wonder how the others are doing.

91
00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.410
Wanna know what's goin' on.

92
00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.080
Idiots better not be dead!

93
00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.080
[USOPP]
What?

94
00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:15.260
What do ya mean I have
to pair with Eyelash?

95
00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:18.150
[crying]

96
00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:21.360
Look! He's a camel!

97
00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:24.330
I'm very fragile, so I need
someone who can back me up!

98
00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.080
[EYELASH grunts]

99
00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.480
Man up. The raffle was fair.

100
00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.370
You got Eyelash,
and that's that.

101
00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:30.370
Fine! But you better
promise me one thing.

102
00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.570
When me and this stupid camel

103
00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.270
are standing at the
doorway of death,

104
00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.710
please come to our rescue!

105
00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:38.770
Sorry. I only save the
damsels. You're on your own.

106
00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.710
[ZORO]
Usopp.

107
00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:46.750
[SANJI]
Hey, what's wrong?

108
00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.560
Usopp! Why're you crying?

109
00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:51.260
Who's crying? I'm not crying!

110
00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.320
You're crying! Yeah!

111
00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.080
"He who smelt it dealt it."
Yeah, that's it...

112
00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.550
[SANJI]
That doesn't even make sense.

113
00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.810
You're a dealter.
A dealter-smealter.

114
00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:02.480
That old hag said... Luffy...

115
00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:06.080
She said Luffy's dead, so I...

116
00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:08.480
I wonder if it's true.

117
00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:11.180
Come on! You guys
really believe that?

118
00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.290
Of course not! Luffy's alive!
What do ya think we are, stupid?

119
00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:17.190
That's right! I don't believe
it either! Luffy is alive!

120
00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:18.690
[EYELASH grunts]

121
00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.230
Yeah, all right, I get it.

122
00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.540
You're preaching to the choir here.

123
00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:25.410
What we have to do now is get to the palace ASAP.

124
00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.580
Now, if ya don't mind,
try to plug your snot,

125
00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.320
at least until the rumbling from the battle stops.

126
00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:31.690
[USOPP snorts]

127
00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.600
[SANJI]
Don't swallow it!

128
00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.680
Thank you, everyone.

129
00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.780
You're welcome, but it's too early to thank us.

130
00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:41.690
He's right.

131
00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.490
Besides, if you really
wanna thank pirates,

132
00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:46.300
you have to let us see some goods.

133
00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.540
Nami, what is it you're trying

134
00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.440
to leach out of this
country, anyway?

135
00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:55.280
[ZORO]
Is Nami okay?
Did she manage to get away?

136
00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:58.430
<b>Behind the Medi Assembly Hall
Alubarna North Block</b>

137
00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.370
[NAMI sighs]

138
00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.280
[NAMI]
They finally came off.

139
00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.820
Calling it a powerful
one-shot attack?

140
00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:09.220
Think that's a bit of
an understatement.

141
00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.460
The fighting's come far.

142
00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.300
They're right there, just around the corner.

143
00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.620
[NAMI]
Guess the situation's changed.

144
00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.180
Anyway, I better get to the palace.

145
00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.920
[ZORO]
Sounds like
the battle's started.

146
00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.850
What about Vivi?

147
00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.090
[SANJI]
Oh, yeah.

148
00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:36.370
One more thing, and this is an
important fact to remember.

149
00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.200
After a battle, these guys put down a ton of food.

150
00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.630
'Kay.

151
00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.830
We'll be waiting for you!

152
00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:47.500
[LUFFY]
Yeah!

153
00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.570
[SANJI]
This is absolutely crucial.

154
00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.240
[DUCK A squawks]

155
00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.180
[DUCK B squawks]

156
00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.840
[ZORO]
Don't screw this up!

157
00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:57.610
[SANJI]
Let's go! See you at the palace!

158
00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.520
Chaka!

159
00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:15.990
[CROCODILE chuckles]

160
00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.060
Weakness is a crime...

161
00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.360
...punishable by death.

162
00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:27.000
[KOZA]
Vivi!

163
00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>Palace Square
25 Minutes Until the Explosion</b>

164
00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:45.050
No. Koza.

165
00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.380
[CROCODILE]
Huh?

166
00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:52.160
It's you.

167
00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:56.260
I see you came through the shortcut you used to use.

168
00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.360
This can't be.
What am I seeing here?

169
00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.000
[KOZA]
I came in hope of
persuading the royal army,

170
00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:13.230
but...

171
00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:17.450
[KOZA]
Chaka...

172
00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.770
And the king is...

173
00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:23.020
He's about to be killed by this country's hero.

174
00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:25.180
I can't believe my eyes.

175
00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.010
[laughing]

176
00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:30.420
Now things are starting
to get interesting!

177
00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.450
Here we are in the
midst of an epic war,

178
00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:35.260
and yet, the leaders of both
sides aren't on the battlefield.

179
00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.930
Fate has placed them
squabbling at my feet!

180
00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:40.430
A battle to the death
between two broken titans

181
00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:43.370
bleeding out the last
remnants of their power!

182
00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:47.410
You seem lost and confused.

183
00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:52.910
Don't worry. It's a natural
reaction. Let me help you.

184
00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:54.410
Relax and open your mind.

185
00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:58.180
Then imagine being faced with
the worst possible scenario.

186
00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:02.680
Koza!

187
00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:05.920
[TOTO]
Koza, purge your heart of all suspicion.

188
00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.190
Do you love this country?

189
00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.110
This is my home.

190
00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.940
[COBRA]
Mine as well!

191
00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:31.060
Koza, listen!

192
00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:32.260
[KOZA]
Vivi!

193
00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:34.760
Who is responsible for the
drought ravaging this country?

194
00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:37.230
Tell me!

195
00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.600
It was...!

196
00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:41.260
[CROCODILE]
That honor belongs to me.

197
00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.620
Over the past two years,

198
00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.020
each and every malicious
deed you attributed

199
00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:48.260
to the king's doing was in fact
perpetrated by my company.

200
00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.300
A trap that saw you playing right into our hands.

201
00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:55.430
It was a flawless, systematic plot of deception.

202
00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:57.900
I must say, it was entertaining

203
00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.640
watching as the royal family
and its mighty army

204
00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.160
desperately chased our shadows.

205
00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:07.200
[CROCODILE laughs]

206
00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.200
[CROCODILE]
Pity.

207
00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.260
You probably would've
died in ignorant bliss

208
00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.330
not knowing these brutal facts.

209
00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:15.200
[CROCODILE laughs]

210
00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:22.110
Koza! Listen!

211
00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:23.390
Majesty!

212
00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:26.220
There's still some time
if you have the courage!

213
00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:30.460
You must act now. Save as
many citizens as you can.

214
00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.900
[CHAKA]
In less than half an hour,

215
00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:36.320
the whole Palace Square will
be blown to kingdom come!

216
00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.030
What do ya mean?!

217
00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:40.800
So, you're still alive, are you?

218
00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.870
Hurry!

219
00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.710
[CROCODILE]
Hm?

220
00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.340
[VIVI]
Stop!

221
00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.370
[gasps]
Vivi!

222
00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:05.170
Get off of me!

223
00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.980
What're you doing?
There's no time!

224
00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.820
The battle is about to
spill into the Square!

225
00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:12.260
If it's really set to blow up, get off!

226
00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.450
You have to listen to me!

227
00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.950
[VIVI]
Think this through. Please.

228
00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.460
What will happen if
you tell the armies

229
00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:22.290
the Square is set to explode?

230
00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.820
The men will panic.

231
00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:25.830
It would only add more chaos to the battle.

232
00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:29.430
And even if you stop the bomb,
it won't stop the fighting!

233
00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.950
Either way, people are still going to die!

234
00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.220
You won't save anyone!

235
00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.560
Understand?

236
00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:44.460
[chuckles]
Well, well,
what a perceptive girl.

237
00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.370
Our only hope is to do
what should've been done

238
00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.200
from the start.

239
00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:54.540
We have to stop the rebellion and end this bloodshed!

240
00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.710
And you...

241
00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:59.110
You're the only one who can do it!

242
00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:13.120
Vivi.

243
00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:20.460
Did you really think
I was going to sit back

244
00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:24.190
and watch passively while
you tried to ruin my plans?

245
00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:30.630
[yells]

246
00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.240
Chaka!

247
00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.670
[CROCODILE]
Huh?

248
00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:39.880
[CHAKA]
I am...

249
00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.140
...Alabasta's guardian deity.

250
00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.410
I am...

251
00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.450
...the Jackal!

252
00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:51.420
I'll fight as long as there
is breath left in my body.

253
00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.760
Some call that brave, I call it stupid.

254
00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:56.930
[CHAKA]
Do what you must, both of you!

255
00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:00.330
I will hold him back for a few more minutes!

256
00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:03.930
[KOZA]
Chaka.

257
00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:06.390
[CHAKA]
Such a shame the leader of the Sand-Sand Clan

258
00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.260
is so weak.

259
00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.980
Boy? What's the matter?

260
00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.920
[KOZA growls]

261
00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.250
[KOZA]
Ah!

262
00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:23.420
What's wrong with
you?! I'm a child!

263
00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.260
You can't treat me like this!

264
00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.190
You're a pain in the neck, kid.

265
00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:31.150
Koza, you asked me to train

266
00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:34.030
you. Have you forgotten that already?

267
00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:49.010
[ROYAL SOLDIER A]
Report from Guard Unit 2
to Headquarters!

268
00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.980
Report from Unit 2 to Headquarters!

269
00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:56.110
Line 4 has been breached!
Enemy has broken through!

270
00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.780
[ROYAL SOLDIER A]
The rebel army is currently passing

271
00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:00.250
through the Central Plaza,
heading to the North Block!

272
00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.850
They will reach the palace!

273
00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:05.530
Raise the flag to surrender!

274
00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.600
Royal army! You will
surrender immediately!

275
00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.700
Princess Vivi! Is she serious?

276
00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:12.800
But why?

277
00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:13.700
That's absurd!

278
00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:14.650
If we do as she says,

279
00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.940
that would mean the
end of this country!

280
00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:19.180
[ROYAL SOLDIER A]
Hey, look! That's...!

281
00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.460
It's Koza!

282
00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:24.730
What is the rebel army's leader
doing here in the palace?

283
00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:27.770
Hear me! The princess
speaks the truth!

284
00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:31.750
We no longer desire victory,
only to end this conflict!

285
00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.220
Both sides have spilled enough blood!

286
00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.620
[ROYAL SOLDIERS chattering]

287
00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.320
I will make each and every rebel understand

288
00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.330
the pointlessness of this civil war!

289
00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:48.740
They will see as I do that we
no longer have reason to fight!

290
00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.770
In the interest of restoring peace and preserving life,

291
00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:54.340
I ask you, wave the white flag!

292
00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.180
Please!

293
00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.450
[REBEL SOLDIER A]
The king's head
will roll this day!

294
00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:03.050
[REBEL SOLDIER B]
Ah! I can see
the clock tower up ahead!

295
00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:11.860
[REBEL SOLDIER A]
We're approaching
the Palace Square!

296
00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:15.030
Prepare to attack!

297
00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.050
[yelling]

298
00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.850
[REBEL SOLDIER D]
Wait, stop!

299
00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:34.730
[REBEL SOLDIER D]
White flags?

300
00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.730
The royal army is waving white flags!

301
00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.930
We did it! They surrender!

302
00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.910
It's Koza!

303
00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:48.280
[KOZA]
The battle is over!

304
00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:53.820
Everyone! Quiet your anger
and lower your weapons!

305
00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:55.490
The Royal Army will stand down!

306
00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:58.790
Let no more blood stain the streets!

307
00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:04.060
[VIVI]
Please listen to him.

308
00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:22.230
Is this the truth, Koza?

309
00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:25.470
Yes. The battle's finally over.

310
00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:28.740
[gunshots]

311
00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.330
[VIVI]
Koza!

312
00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.470
[KOZA]
You just wait
until it's finished.

313
00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.640
This town will bring
good fortune and joy

314
00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.510
to so many people!

315
00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.310
It's gonna be the
best town ever!

316
00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.210
When it's up and running,

317
00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:06.070
I'll personally give
you the grand tour.

318
00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:16.780
[KOZA]
Don't fight, rebel army.

319
00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:19.750
Don't fight them.

320
00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:26.370
[REBEL SOLDIERS chattering]

321
00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.370
[REBEL SOLDIER E]
How could they shoot Koza?!

322
00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:29.440
[REBEL SOLDIER F]
Get them!

323
00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:31.440
[REBEL SOLDIERS yelling]

324
00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:35.450
[BAROQUE WORKS
MEMBER A chuckling]

325
00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:37.590
[VIVI]
It's Baroque Works!

326
00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:48.930
What did you do?
Why did you shoot?

327
00:20:56.410 --> 00:21:01.080
Listen to me now,
rebel army. Do not fight.

328
00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.150
[ROYAL SOLDIER K]
What's goin' on?

329
00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:07.220
Where'd this
sandstorm come from?

330
00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.320
Listen, rebel army...

331
00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:13.410
[gunshot]

332
00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.660
They're shooting at us!

333
00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:15.760
How dare they!

334
00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:18.310
[growling]

335
00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.000
Where did all this sand
come from so suddenly?

336
00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.170
We can't see anything!

337
00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.040
[gunshot]

338
00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:36.520
Damn it! Bastards!

339
00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.550
[ROYAL SOLDIER H]
Don't shoot carelessly!

340
00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.050
[REBEL SOLDIER C]
What's going on?

341
00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.290
Heh! They still don't
know what's happening.

342
00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:48.670
What's going on, you idiots,
is that Baroque Works members

343
00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:52.110
are posing as soldiers
in both your armies.

344
00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:57.050
[SOLDIERS yelling]

345
00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.530
Stop! No!

346
00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:01.140
Come on! Just hang in there!

347
00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:11.060
They aren't surrendering.

348
00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:14.730
Thought they'd ambush us by
raising a phony white flag, huh?

349
00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:18.240
So this is how the royal
army plans to win.

350
00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:20.800
By using dirty tricks like that?

351
00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:27.250
Stop it!

352
00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:30.480
No, don't do this!
Please stop fighting!

353
00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:33.880
Soldiers! Look up here!

354
00:22:36.220 --> 00:22:38.920
[KOZA]
Stop... rebel army.

355
00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:42.590
Stop this! This battle is...

356
00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:53.640
[inaudible]

357
00:22:56.400 --> 00:22:57.870
Hey, are you okay?

358
00:22:57.900 --> 00:22:59.400
Damn!

359
00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:02.700
Now, royal army!
Launch counterattack!

360
00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:12.210
[inaudible]

361
00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:35.540
[VIVI]
Stop it...

362
00:23:35.570 --> 00:23:37.470
Stop fighting!

363
00:23:39.740 --> 00:23:41.610
Please don't fight.

364
00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:44.950
Stop now!

365
00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:48.690
You fought long and hard, Princess, and did well.

366
00:23:48.720 --> 00:23:52.190
But now... give up.

367
00:23:52.220 --> 00:23:55.230
Your voice will no longer reach them.

368
00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:57.580
So this is it.

369
00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:04.220
You have to run away, Vivi!

370
00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:07.960
Get away from him!
Before it's too late!

371
00:24:16.230 --> 00:24:17.630
I won't.

372
00:24:21.680 --> 00:24:25.820
You made this dust devil.
It's your doing, isn't it?

373
00:24:27.690 --> 00:24:30.330
But still...

374
00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:32.300
There's time.

375
00:24:32.330 --> 00:24:34.860
If I stop the explosion that's
scheduled in 15 minutes,

376
00:24:34.860 --> 00:24:37.970
I can still reduce the
number of casualties.

377
00:24:42.570 --> 00:24:45.340
If I try this, the
rebellion will stop.

378
00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:48.710
If I try that, the
rebellion will stop.

379
00:24:48.820 --> 00:24:52.060
It's time to wake up, Princess.

380
00:24:52.090 --> 00:24:56.500
I'm tired of your useless
idealism. It's gotten pathetic.

381
00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:00.760
What good are your happy ideals

382
00:25:00.760 --> 00:25:03.030
if you can't do anything
to make them reality?

383
00:25:03.090 --> 00:25:05.830
Then they're nothing but dreams.

384
00:25:05.870 --> 00:25:09.310
And your dreams don't stand a chance.

385
00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:12.780
I don't care what you
think of my ideals.

386
00:25:14.750 --> 00:25:17.620
I'm never going to
give up on them.

387
00:25:20.720 --> 00:25:22.890
You would never understand!

388
00:25:22.920 --> 00:25:24.420
I'm this country's Princess.

389
00:25:24.480 --> 00:25:28.620
I won't give up! I won't
give in, no matter what!

390
00:25:33.130 --> 00:25:36.670
You really are a sad little girl.

391
00:25:36.670 --> 00:25:41.440
[VIVI]
I refuse... to give up.

392
00:25:43.880 --> 00:25:47.550
I will save... Alabasta!

393
00:25:54.020 --> 00:25:55.190
Vivi!

394
00:25:59.320 --> 00:26:03.460
You have only 15 minutes until
the Square is blown up.

395
00:26:03.490 --> 00:26:06.290
More of the rebel
forces are gathering

396
00:26:06.290 --> 00:26:09.530
as reinforcements arrive.

397
00:26:09.600 --> 00:26:13.340
One after another,
without even realizing

398
00:26:13.370 --> 00:26:15.800
they're marching to their death.

399
00:26:25.380 --> 00:26:27.450
You know, you could've
let the royal army

400
00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:29.950
know about the coming
explosion earlier.

401
00:26:29.980 --> 00:26:32.550
If so, maybe there
would've been a panic,

402
00:26:32.620 --> 00:26:37.660
but then you could've saved tens
of thousands of innocent lives.

403
00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:39.190
Stop it!

404
00:26:39.230 --> 00:26:42.860
Please, Crocodile!
Just let her go!

405
00:26:46.300 --> 00:26:48.570
In the end, your plans
for saving this country

406
00:26:48.640 --> 00:26:51.170
have done more harm than good.

407
00:26:51.240 --> 00:26:53.350
Your wretched failures have only ended up

408
00:26:53.380 --> 00:26:57.750
hurting the precious citizens who you love so dearly.

409
00:27:02.730 --> 00:27:04.900
[CROCODILE]
From the beginning
of my operations here,

410
00:27:04.980 --> 00:27:08.950
the sheer stupidity of your country has amused me.

411
00:27:08.980 --> 00:27:13.520
So pathetic. So easy
to manipulate.

412
00:27:19.720 --> 00:27:22.460
[CROCODILE]
You did a decent
job of spying on our company

413
00:27:22.490 --> 00:27:26.860
for the past two years,
I will grant you that much.

414
00:27:26.900 --> 00:27:31.340
[TOTO]
It's me, Vivi.
Don't you recognize me?

415
00:27:31.370 --> 00:27:33.040
I look different.

416
00:27:33.080 --> 00:27:35.720
I lost some weight, I suppose.

417
00:27:35.750 --> 00:27:36.520
[CROCODILE]
Heh.

418
00:27:36.550 --> 00:27:38.490
But when it was all said and done,

419
00:27:38.520 --> 00:27:41.920
you really had no hope of changing anything.

420
00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:45.930
Stopping the rebellion.
Saving the kingdom.

421
00:27:45.990 --> 00:27:50.030
All those worthless ideas you've clung to for so long.

422
00:27:50.030 --> 00:27:55.170
In the end, they just created more victims for me.

423
00:27:55.200 --> 00:27:58.840
Let me tell you something.

424
00:27:58.870 --> 00:28:01.880
You're never going to save this country.

425
00:28:03.710 --> 00:28:06.540
Goodbye, Princess.

426
00:28:06.540 --> 00:28:09.000
[screams]

427
00:28:09.000 --> 00:28:15.000
[CROCODILE laughing]

428
00:28:24.180 --> 00:28:29.350
[laughing continues]

429
00:28:50.570 --> 00:28:53.110
[CROCODILE]
It can't be.

430
00:28:53.170 --> 00:28:58.040
[LUFFY]
Crocodile!

431
00:29:01.010 --> 00:29:02.750
Luffy!

432
00:29:03.880 --> 00:29:05.120
[growls]

433
00:29:05.180 --> 00:29:07.550
It can't be!
